abstract: >-
  This conceptual architecture proposes human function as a common relational
  and computational coordinate for joint interpretation of heterogeneous human
  models while preserving their native domain meanings. UOHF supplies semantic
  identities and governed relations, while HFWM coordinates a typed,
  person-bound model network, evidence qualification, and longitudinal updates.
